<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6930" root="حبش" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبَاشَةٌ</span></b>  <i>What is collected,</i> (S, * and TA in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هبش</span>,) of men, and of property; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُبَاشَةٌ</span>:
(TA ubi suprà:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبَاشَاتٌ</span>. (S, and TA ubi
suprà.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A company,</i> or <i>body, of men, not of
one tribe;</i> (S, K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُبَاشَةٌ</span>; (TA;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُحْبُوشٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحَابِيشُ</span>; (S;) or as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُحْبُوشَةٌ</span></b> ,
(K, TA,) of which the pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحَابِيشُ</span>; (TA:) the
pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حباشة</span> in this sense is as above. (TA.)

